**Divisors on a curve:** Weil divisors `⊕_x ℤ` and Cartier divisors; the dictionaries
  `Cartier ≃ line bundles` and (smooth curve) `Weil ≃ Cartier`; principal divisors;
  `Cl(X) ≅ Pic X`.
